---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { t } from '../../i18n/index.js';
---

<LegalPage
  locale="en"
  metaTitle={t('en', 'legal', 'termsMetaTitle')}
  metaDescription={t('en', 'legal', 'termsMetaDescription')}
  pageTitle="Terms of use"
  canonicalPath="/en/terms"
>
  <h2>Free scanner</h2>
  <p>
    The scan is free and generates a public report accessible by link. We do not guarantee 100%
    uptime or that every AI agent will interpret the results the same way.
  </p>

  <h2>Public reports</h2>
  <p>
    Anyone with the link can view the report. We do not include personal data, only the scanned URL
    and the technical score.
  </p>

  <h2>Implementation services</h2>
  <p>
    Published prices are reference values. The final quote depends on the size and complexity of
    the site. Work is coordinated by email and invoiced before we start.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    Listo Pa Bots is a diagnostic tool. We are not liable for changes in rankings, traffic, or
    third-party agent behavior after using the tool or hiring the implementation service.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
